tly used action.url (which already contains the full path with ID from UrlBuilder)\n- This inconsistency could cause confusion and potential bugs\n\nSolution:\n- Removed the unused url variable construction\n- DELETE requests now consistently use action.url which is built by UrlBuilder with all required parameters including the ID\n\nThe UrlBuilder automatically extracts the ID from the model (UrlBuilder.php:95-109),\nso no manual ID concatenation is needed in the frontend.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2025-10-28T09:30:41Z", "repo": "buildora", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d2e8052cb1f22baca078b85630808523677ac61c", "message": "Merge pull request #101 from ginkelsoft-development/feature/buildora-default-resources\n\nsdad", "created_at": "2025-10-21T09:01:08Z", "repo": "buildora", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0871c5adf5899b63f8668d8036db2ad25964477d", "message": "sdad", "created_at": "2025-10-21T09:00:31Z", "repo": "buildora", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d89268b575d3054af3607286bad167c0669454a0", "message": "Merge pull request #100 from ginkelsoft-development/feature/buildora-default-resources\n\nsdad", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:54:05Z", "repo": "buildora", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f0962af45f37161de38572ee39a6fe1abc7635f4", "message": "sdad", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:53:35Z", "repo": "buildora", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3e145de6002f5c7967237b32aa477d123d035d9b", "message": "Merge pull request #99 from ginkelsoft-development/feature/buildora-default-resources\n\nsdad", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:46:05Z", "repo": "buildora", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}],